sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Drv as QA driver (step 4)
    participant Lib as probeRoomPaneAlive
    participant Host as 宿主 tmux server
    participant Room as 房间 tmux server<br/>TMUX_TMPDIR=slotDir
    participant Cls as classifyImplementPark
    Note over Drv,Host: 修复前
    Drv->>Host: display-message -t runner-test-slot-4:@5
    Host-->>Drv: 找不到 (exit≠0) → dead
    Drv->>Cls: liveness=dead
    Cls-->>Drv: null → 无限等待
    Note over Drv,Room: 修复后
    Drv->>Lib: target, executionId, slotDir
    Lib->>Lib: slotDir 必须绝对路径 否则抛错<br/>env += TMUX_TMPDIR, 删 TMUX/TMUX_PANE
    Lib->>Room: display-message window|pane|dead|exec_id
    Room-->>Lib: @5|%7|0|implement-exec
    Lib-->>Drv: alive (exec_id 匹配)
    Drv->>Cls: liveness=alive
    Cls-->>Drv: rework_reachable_wait → 进入 step 5
